---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Delhi 2025 | Nagrik Party"
  description="Arsalan Azad's independent candidacy in the Delhi 2025 Assembly election from Okhla: the starting point of Nagrik Party."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mini-label" style="background: rgba(179, 74, 21, 0.08); color: var(--saffron);">
        ELECTORAL BACKGROUND · DELHI 2025
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-family: var(--font-serif); margin: 10px 0 14px;">
        Delhi 2025 Assembly Election
      </h1>
      <p class="page-copy">
        Arsalan Azad contested the Delhi 2025 Assembly election independently from Okhla Assembly Constituency, South-East Delhi. This election was the starting point of the transition from independent public work to building Nagrik Party.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="legal-article">
          <h2>Election Context</h2>
          <p>
            The Delhi 2025 Assembly election saw Arsalan Azad stand as an Independent candidate from Okhla. Public election records list the result as 270 votes received. The campaign was issue-focused and built around direct and digital outreach.
          </p>

          <h2>Campaign Approach</h2>
          <p>
            The campaign prioritised local civic issues over identity-based mobilisation. Outreach was built through direct engagement with residents and digital communication channels. The focus was on documenting public problems and proposing transparent governance solutions.
          </p>

          <h2>From Election to Party</h2>
          <p>
            The independent candidacy demonstrated that issue-based politics needs institutional infrastructure to scale. Nagrik Party is being built as that institutional step: a member-driven party where public work is tracked, civic issues are filed lawfully, and every action produces a visible record.
          </p>

          <div class="notice" style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <strong>Public record source:</strong> Election results and candidate details are from public ADR/MyNeta archives and Election Commission records.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div style="display: grid; gap: 14px;">
            <div class="card feature" style="padding: 18px;">
              <span class="mini-label">Constituency</span>
              <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">Okhla</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 14px;">South-East Delhi</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card feature" style="padding: 18px;">
              <span class="mini-label">Category</span>
              <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">Independent</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 14px;">No party affiliation at the time of election</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card feature" style="padding: 18px;">
              <span class="mini-label">Campaign style</span>
              <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">Issue-focused</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 14px;">Direct and digital outreach on civic issues</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section band-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="action-row" style="justify-content: center;">
        <a class="button" href="/founder">
          &larr; Back to Founder
        </a>
        <a class="button" href="/president/okhla">
          Okhla Constituency &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
